{'symbol': 'VLO', 'date': '2022-10-25 06:33:00', 'title': 'VALERO ENERGY REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'SAN ANTONIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VALERO ENERGY CORPORATION (NYSE: VLO, “VALERO”) TODAY REPORTED NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO VALERO STOCKHOLDERS OF $2.8 BILLION, OR $7.19 PER SHARE, FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2022, COMPARED TO $463 MILLION, OR $1.13 PER SHARE, FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021.'}